  "verified_behaviors": [
    "Two tenants use real single-file and two-part protected snapshots for filtered CTE joins and aggregates; actual Arrow values and durable part digests are checked.",
    "Foreign handles are denied. Hidden datasets, forged requests, stale authority and unsupported requests reject before source work; hidden-column fills produce ExportFailed and no downloadable result.",
    "Repeated Ready downloads, including a replacement key for the same principal, return identical stored bytes without another SQL execution or protected-source read.",
    "Revocation before Ready withholds publication; revocation during download withholds final public completion across requested none/LZ4 and length/chunked framing.",
    "A lost completion response is not replayed; actual local parts and receipt remain retained while gateway status is Cancelled.",
    "Cancellation during a source range and a 50 ms drain during stalled registry release preserve custody until cleanup completes."
  ],
