  "redactions": [
    "VM addresses, usernames, private paths, process identifiers and fixture credentials are excluded; raw logs and exact identities remain in the private packet."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "VM acceptance covers the stated source; hosted CI, merged cargo, release and deployment require separate evidence. No throughput, RSS, whole-node memory or production capacity claim.",
    "Local TLS fixtures verify tenant roles, object identity, CAS and reader pins. They do not certify live cloud IAM, signatures or vendor behavior; dedicated provider gates remain separate.",
    "Ready downloads read local durable parts. Revocation is local to the tested gateway, does not revoke an authorized replacement key and cannot recall delivered bytes.",
    "Final-byte barriers use complete actual stored Arrow parts; they do not simulate client Body.Close or prove earlier partial delivery. The registry-drain proof covers the recorded 50 ms interval.",
    "LZ4 gates check requested durable codec, decoded values, digests and framing; they do not independently inspect physical IPC compression metadata.",
    "Outer bridge files are independently rehashed; child bridge inputs retain runner before/after provenance. Workspace scans are sampled logical storage, not RSS or a filesystem quota."
  ]
}
